                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Akimara kwima yica ab'inzu ya Yerobowamu bose, ntiyamusigira n'umwe uhumeka kugeza aho yamutsembeye rwose, nk'uko Uwiteka yavugiye mu kanwa k'umugaragu we Ahiya w'i Shilo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
