        {
          "text": "Mu mwaka wa gatatu wo ku ngoma ya Asa umwami w'i Buyuda, Bāsha mwene Ahiya yimye muri Isirayeli hose atura i Tirusa, amara imyaka makumyabiri n'ine ari ku ngoma. ",
